Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.83,0:00:20.58,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Quod Erat Demonstrandum Demons
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.58,0:00:22.75,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Quod Erat Demons
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:39.69,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}空っぽな器に　迫り来る闇の方へ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.89,0:00:41.73,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}さあ　恐れず証明をしよう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.73,0:00:43.73,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}錯覚と遊べるように
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.73,0:00:46.07,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}who am I?  I am who I am
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.07,0:00:51.45,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}１つだけ確かな真実に迫る
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.45,0:00:55.79,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}血が通う手とパペットが重なってショータイム
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.79,0:00:59.79,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}不純物がなくなれば
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.79,0:01:04.67,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)}本当の姿だってわかるだろうか
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.30,0:01:08.72,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)}踊れこの夜に　Are You Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.72,0:01:13.72,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}鮮やかな生命塗れ撒き散らして
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.72,0:01:16.31,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}踊り子の夜に　Q.E.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.31,0:01:20.19,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}フィクションのような　闇と狂気の間で
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.19,0:01:23.94,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}ねえ　迷迷証明　今核心を
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.94,0:01:28.94,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}ほら　君の命が暴くから
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.94,0:01:32.82,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Quod Erat Demonstrandum Demons
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.82,0:01:34.74,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Quod Erat Demons
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.49,0:01:40.46,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Quod Erat Demonstrandum Demons
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:42.75,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Quod Erat Demons
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:39.69,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}容器空空如也  黑暗迎面迫近
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.89,0:00:41.73,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}來吧  不要恐懼  去給出證明
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.73,0:00:43.73,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}只為與錯覺徘徊周旋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.73,0:00:46.07,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}我是誰?  我即是我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.07,0:00:51.45,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}逼近那唯一確定的真實
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.45,0:00:55.79,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}活人之手與傀儡重疊的表演時刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.79,0:00:59.79,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}如果雜質能消失
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.79,0:01:04.67,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)}是否得以知曉真身
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.30,0:01:08.72,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)}在這夜晚起舞吧  Are You Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.72,0:01:13.72,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}沾滿鮮活的生命並噴薄四散
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.72,0:01:16.31,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}起舞之人的夜晚  Q.E.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.31,0:01:20.19,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}宛若虛構般  在黑暗與瘋狂間
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.19,0:01:23.94,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}迷途的證明  此刻直指核心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.94,0:01:28.94,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}看吧  你的生命暴露無遺
